				<wikidot:authorName>Str4ng3</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5630610</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>+1</p> <p>I don't really enjoy all the &quot;haha [fetish I dislike] weird and bad&quot; stuff, but this skip has a lot of good jokes that earned my upvote, especially:</p> <p><em>&quot;The dive was originally going to consist of 3 members diving in a &quot;T&quot; formation before a logistics technician pointed out that without an individual in the intersection of the tethers, the formation would resemble a &quot;Y&quot; more than anything. Subsequent analysis concluded that the only satisfactory method of conducting a diving expedition in a true &quot;T&quot; shape would be to add one additional member on the intersection and replace the tethers with rigid steel rods to preserve the integrity of the &quot;T&quot;.&quot;</em></p> <p>This footnote is fucking great.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
